              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mumuyika kwamakhumi kataru nomusaafu kwobwarwi bwaYehoyakhini omuruchi waYuda, mumwesi kwekhumi nakhabili, nikuli amakhumi kabili nomusaafu, Ewili-merodakhi omuruchi waBabeli, mumuyika okwo okwa yachaachilamwo okhuruka, yachinguula omurwe kwaYehoyakhini omuruchi waYuda, namurusia mumbohe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "namusunjila akeshisa, nara eshifumbishie emukulu webifumbi biabaruchi aba yali ninabo muBabeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Yehoyakhini nakalukhasia tsingubotsie tsiobubohe; ne naliitsanga khumeesa yomuruchi tsindaalo tsiosi tsiobulamubwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.25.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 25:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne khulwa omukabokwe, yakabilungwa buli nyanga nomuruchi omukabo nalebe kwabuli nyanga, tsindaalo tsiosi tsiobulamubwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.25.30",
